5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 机动队！王牌战术.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/26/9w8041bymmz0zfd09earciqrys98hvy.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%9C%BA%E5%8A%A8%E9%98%9F%EF%BC%81%E7%8E%8B%E7%89%8C%E6%88%98%E6%9C%AF.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/26/9w8041bymmz0zfd09earciqrys98hvy.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%9C%BA%E5%8A%A8%E9%98%9F%EF%BC%81%E7%8E%8B%E7%89%8C%E6%88%98%E6%9C%AF.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/26/9w8041bymmz0zfd09earciqrys98hvy.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />机动队！王牌战术\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-5\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（支援）对目标施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"窥破弱点\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">窥破弱点</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合；并使距离目标范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内最近的<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>名友军，使用普攻进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"援护攻击\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">援护攻击</font></span></span>]，可造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>伤害。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-5 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/95/at4dr45s2ma4cti9dv4gkekpa78egvl.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/95/at4dr45s2ma4cti9dv4gkekpa78egvl.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%B4%A2%E8%8F%B2%E4%BA%9A%E2%80%A2%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A5%E7%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A\" title=\"角色图鉴库/索菲亚•夏日约定\"><img alt=\"头像 索菲亚•夏日约定.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d0/nxkr945r9xdfhlt9mt9s3px7qqg39ek.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">索菲亚•夏日约定</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: spa